    {
      "ID": "38613",
      "LogTitle": "'No Wings Required'",
      "LogDescription": "'Use the Stormforged Grapple Launcher to launch over the wall at Hrydshal.'",
      "QuestDescription": "'That thing looks like it\\'s got the range to get us over the wall. There\\'s a good spot to hook onto right past us - you should be able to spot it from here.\\n\\nOnce you\\'re inside, do me a favor and see if you can distract the guards so I can slip through. I\\'ll see what else I can find out about these vrykul.'",
      "Flags": "37748744",
      "FlagsEx": "4",
      "RewardNextQuest": "38615",
      "RewardItem1": "0",
      "RewardAmount1": "0",
      "RewardSpell": "0"
    },
    {
      "ID": "38612",
      "LogTitle": "'A Grapple a Day'",
      "LogDescription": "'Pick up a Stormforged Grapple Launcher and meet Dread-Rider Cullen outside the wall of Hrydshal.'",
      "QuestDescription": "'So some old magic vrykul is helping us out? I guess that\\'s good, but this trial of yours might be tricky. You see, the only way up that mountain, is through those big walls.\\n\\nYou know, the ones with the mean-looking drakes on them.\\n\\nI scouted a bit, but couldn\\'t get too far without those drakes trying to make lunch out of poor Duchess. The vrykul have them trained, which can\\'t be good.\\n\\nI say we sneak in. I managed to snag a few grapple launchers earlier. Grab one and meet me outside the city walls.'",
      "Flags": "35651592",
      "FlagsEx": "8192",
      "RewardNextQuest": "38613",
      "RewardItem1": "0",
      "RewardAmount1": "0",
      "RewardSpell": "191831"
    },
    {
      "ID": "38318",
      "LogTitle": "'No Wings Required'",
      "LogDescription": "'Go to the top of the ridge and use the Stormforged Grapple Launcher to launch over the wall at Hrydshal.'",
      "QuestDescription": "'Now that you\\'ve got the launcher, we should be able to infiltrate the city. It looks like there\\'s a good spot to grapple onto on the wall just past us. There\\'s a vantage point on top of this ridge.\\n\\nOnce we\\'re in, I\\'ll try to slip past the guards and get a look at the mountain path. I\\'d appreciate if you could make some distractions for me. If all goes well, I\\'ll meet up with you in the upper city.\\n\\nGood luck!'",
      "Flags": "37748744",
      "FlagsEx": "4",
      "RewardNextQuest": "38410",
      "RewardItem1": "0",
      "RewardAmount1": "0",
      "RewardSpell": "0"
    },
    {
      "ID": "38312",
      "LogTitle": "'A Grapple a Day'",
      "LogDescription": "'Pick up a Stormforged Grapple Launcher and meet Lorna Crowley outside the wall of Hrydshal.'",
      "QuestDescription": "'So these trials are what will get us the Aegis, and the next one is on the top of that mountain? That may prove problematic.\\n\\nThe only way I see up the mountain is through that vrykul city, and the gates are shut tight. We should be able to grapple over, though. If you don\\'t have a launcher, I managed to wrangle a spare from one of these vrykul.\\n\\nI\\'ll scout ahead and see if I can find a good spot to get in.'",
      "Flags": "37748744",
      "FlagsEx": "8192",
      "RewardNextQuest": "38318",
      "RewardItem1": "0",
      "RewardAmount1": "0",
      "RewardSpell": "0"
    }
  ],
